<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10079] FileWriteAheadLogManager may return invalid lastCompactedSegment</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10079</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;As of current &lt;tt&gt;master&lt;/tt&gt; branch, &lt;tt&gt;FileWriteAheadLogManager#lastCompactedSegment&lt;/tt&gt; may report -1 even after some segments have been actually compressed. Reproducer is attached.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
